  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.0.0 - initial release.\n\t\t\t- IAudit and IMetric, the contracts a host's entities implement, with MetricStatus and MetricSpanKind.\n\t\t\t- The ports a host implements: IAuditAndMetricStorageBroker, IAuditUserBroker, IAuditAndMetricsDispatcher and IRequestTraceBroker.\n\t\t\t- The storage exceptions a storage broker raises: AlreadyExists, Locked, InvalidReference and FailedStorage.\n\t\t\t- Guide and sample: https://github.com/NHSISL/NHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics",
